    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1330">

                <pb facs="0896" n="780" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/103.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Davis to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guadalajara</hi>
                        </placeName> (<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1914-11-05T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-10-22T00:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received November 5,
                            1914</hi>).</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm my telegram to
                    you on October 17. I afterwards came in possession of facts in connection with
                    the concession of the Compañía Galletera Nacional which in substance are these:
                    In the articles of concession the Company was exempt from all kind of taxation
                    for a term of twenty years (State taxation), but <pb facs="0897" n="781"
                        xml:id="pg781"/> the concessionaires waived all rights as foreigners in any
                    and everything pertaining to its affairs.</p>
                <p>This latter clause is upon what hinges the persistence of the local authorities
                    here in prosecuting the matter, is my opinion.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Will B. Davis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
